            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " aitwekenyun akecekonye, tetere ibelokinos ainyein amuton kesesenata aica, ainyein da apedor naka Satan kosesenata Edeke, kosodete adumun aisionio adiakanareta, ka airumet kokidiŋ; kaŋul kaluitalaunitai kanuka aiyuun naejai tomakaŋ.’",
          "type": "text",
